  Helper templates

There is no specialization of ranges::enable_borrowed_range for concat_view, because this
would require the iterator implementation to contain a copy of all iterators and sentinels
of all underlying ranges at all times.

.SH Notes

No argument views::concat() is ill-formed, because there is no reasonable way to determine
an element type T. Single argument views::concat(r) is expression equivalent to
views::all(r).

